// Distinct labeled margins on the kept pairs.
// No pair returns nothing. One margin returns one.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE mkinds ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG mkinds rank

IMPULSE mkinds 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "mkinds" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
